<title>BELGIUM: EU sets unchanged molasses import duties.</title>
<headline>EU sets unchanged molasses import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee set molasses import duties unchanged from December, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no change to the tariffs but the reference prices for cane and beet molasses were altered slightly,&quot; after the weekly meeting on Wednesday, the official said.</p>
<p>The duty for cane molasses remained at 0.41 Ecus per 100 kg based on a reference price of 7.33 Ecus per 100 kg compared with the previous figure of 7.32.</p>
<p>Duty on beet molasses remained suspended at zero based on a reference price of 11.40 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 11.38 Ecus previously.</p>
</text>
